   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Safety evals and red teaming",
   "originalText": "Safety evals and red teaming",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "t49",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 498,
   "y": 416.5,
   "width": 1025,
   "height": 56.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "g-p3d"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 8330788,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 110174908,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Mostly before release, but also on checkpoints as training scales. Automated evals, plus red teaming by Anthropic's Frontier Red Team,\noutside experts and the US and UK government AI institutes. They test for dangerous capabilities (CBRN, cyber, autonomy) and alignment\nproblems (deception, sabotage). The results decide the ASL level, which decides what safeguards have to be in place before release.",
   "originalText": "Mostly before release, but also on checkpoints as training scales. Automated evals, plus red teaming by Anthropic's Frontier Red Team,\noutside experts and the US and UK government AI institutes. They test for dangerous capabilities (CBRN, cyber, autonomy) and alignment\nproblems (deception, sabotage). The results decide the ASL level, which decides what safeguards have to be in place before release.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
